** MMP9800 - STATEMENT-RECOGNITION REGRESSION FIXTURE
** Four constructs missed by the scanner, found calibrating against a real
** client corpus: a bare short-form assignment (no ASSIGN keyword), SET
** CONTROL, an INPUT WINDOW block whose column-spec continuation lines are
** prefixed with "/"/"//" (previously only WRITE/DISPLAY/PRINT folded
** column-spec continuations, and only unprefixed ones), and a COMPRESS
** wrapping onto a continuation line via INTO.
DEFINE DATA LOCAL
1 #FLAG (N1)
1 #MESSAGE (A60)
END-DEFINE
*
#FLAG := 1
SET CONTROL 'WA'
INPUT WINDOW = 'W1'
  /  1X 'HELLO' (CD=RE)
  // 1X #MESSAGE (AD=O)
COMPRESS 'A' 'B'
  INTO #MESSAGE
END
